		(property "Description" "2.7-23V (28V abs max), 5.5A, 28mOhm eFuse with true reverse-current blocking, RPW VQFN-10 2x2mm. Pins named for TPS259474A/L. Same pinout for all variants: 470A/L = adj OVLO + current limit, pin3 AUXOFF, pin4 FLT (open drain); 472A/L = OVC select (pin2 OVCSEL), pin3 PG, pin4 PGTH; 474A/L = adj OVLO + circuit breaker, pin3 PG, pin4 PGTH. A=auto-retry, L=latch. EN/UVLO and OVLO: 1.20V rising / 1.09V falling, do not float. ILM: R to GND sets ILIM (750R=4.45A, 1.65k=2.03A, 3334/R), do not float. DVDT: C to GND sets slew (open = fastest). ITIMER: C to GND sets OC blanking (open = fastest)."
			(at 0 18.034 0)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(hide yes)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
